Description: 1k intro for Linux, released in 2013
 Bioterrorism is a 1k intro by Below Absolute Zero, ranked 7th in the
 PC 1k competition at Assembly 2013. A raymarched organic shape and its
 music are generated in real time by a 1 kilobyte executable.
 .
 This package builds the "clean" version provided by the authors, which
 stops at the end of the music or when a key is pressed. It runs in an
 800x600 window.
